abyteDB core features"},{"id":1353907004,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzUzOTA3MDA0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/priority/high","name":"priority/high","color":"ffdc5e","default":false,"description":"High Priority"},{"id":9380979947,"node_id":"LA_kwDOBlCVUc8AAAACLyZk6w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/2025.2%20Backport%20Required","name":"2025.2 Backport Required","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"yusong-yan","id":46516278,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTE2Mjc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46516278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan","html_url":"https://github.com/yusong-yan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"yusong-yan","id":46516278,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTE2Mjc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46516278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan","html_url":"https://github.com/yusong-yan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-11-13T22:28:43Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T22:44:23Z","closed_at":"2025-12-02T22:44:23Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-19143](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-19143)\r\n### Description\n\nIssue: \n\nThe YBDB is not properly escaping metric label values. This create an issue where prometheus is not able to parse the metrics and it results the Tserver process health issue in YBA UI. \n\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"231\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e55dc140-1082-4c96-8d94-ce640d8037b3\" />\n\nThe Prometheus target UI will say for that particular target:  \"expected equal, got INVALID\"\n\n<img width=\"1302\" height=\"352\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a68504a5-252a-41c9-bcf2-263c58513b01\" />\n\nSteps to reproduce: \n\nMake a table with some weird name with quotes. Example: \n```\nyugabyte=# create table \"\"\"yo\"\".\"\"name_split\"\"\"(\"Unnamed: 0\" bigint, full_name text);\nCREATE TABLE\nyugabyte=# \\dt+ \"\"\"yo\"\".\"\"name_split\"\"\";\n                           List of relations\n Schema |       Name        | Type  |  Owner   |  Size   | Description\n--------+-------------------+-------+----------+---------+-------------\n public | \"yo\".\"name_split\" | table | yugabyte | 1024 kB |\n(1 row)\n```\nThe Prometheus target will go in down state as in screenshot. \n\nHow to find this the issue?  \nTake help of `promtool` and check the metrics. \n```\nubuntu@ip-10-9-100-148:~/prometheus-2.44.0.linux-amd64$ curl -ks https://10.9.120.54:9000/prometheus-metrics | ./promtool check metrics\nerror while linting: text format parsing error in line 1764: unexpected end of label value \"\"\n\nubuntu@ip-10-9-100-148:~/prometheus-2.44.0.linux-amd64$ curl -ks https://10.9.120.54:9000/prometheus-metrics > metrics.out\nubuntu@ip-10-9-100-148:~/prometheus-2.44.0.linux-amd64$ vim metrics.out\n\n-------> In the line 1764 you will see table name: \n\nrocksdb_bytes_per_read_sum{metric_type=\"table\",exported_instance=\"yb-dev-agangwar-test-n1\",namespace_name=\"yugabyte\",table_name=\"\"yo\".\"name_split\"\",table_id=\"000033f1000030008000000000004205\"} 0 1687373915630\n```\n\nTo resolve the YBA state we need to drop the table. \nAs per the @Aleksandr Malyshev Here is the logic from Java prom exporter which escapes label values:\n\n```\n  private static void writeEscapedLabelValue(Writer writer, String s) throws IOException {\n    for (int i = 0; i < s.length(); i++) {\n      char c = s.charAt(i);\n      switch (c) {\n        case '\\\\':\n          writer.append(\"\\\\\\\\\");\n          break;\n        case '\\\"':\n          writer.append(\"\\\\\\\"\");\n          break;\n        case '\\n':\n          writer.append(\"\\\\n\");\n          break;\n        default:\n          writer.append(c);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n```\n\n### Issue Type\n\nkind/bug\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [x] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-19143]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-19143?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"yusong-yan","id":46516278,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTE2Mjc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46516278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan","html_url":"https://github.com/yusong-yan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/29351/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/29351/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}